{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The beasts of the earth with you.</b> These are the ones that walk about among people." "<b>Of all who go out of the ark.</b> To include creeping things and swarming things." "<b>The beasts of the earth.</b> To include the harmful creatures — which are not included in 'the beasts that are with you,' for their way is not among people."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:05.742828046Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}